id: pm-context-vusp
title: Validate only context assumptions invalidated on resume
description: "Record section-to-source digests for context packets and return only invalidated assumptions on resume. Acceptance: changed dependencies invalidate dependent packet sections; unchanged packets reuse safely; deleted or unreadable sources fail with a bounded receipt. Provide typed SDK and CLI, compact TOON/JSON, typed refusals with remedies, documentation and non-git public-tracker validation."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T22:14:51.863Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T21:48:18.254Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T22:15:14.936Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: SDK workspace snapshots retain complete files and revisions; core context usage/improvement ledgers record observations and delivery. pm-brief since and pm-context context-pack since report events; pm-memory verify checks memory claims. None validates a declared packet section against item/settings/evidence digests and propagates invalidation through section dependencies. Implement a portable digest-only manifest, typed SDK and context-freshness record/resume commands, with bounded fail-closed receipts. Builds on PR #164; no snapshot store or second delta stream."
  "2026-10-21T22:23:42.686Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses portable digest-only packet manifests with declared item/settings field projections, exact evidence byte digests, acyclic section dependencies and transitive invalidation. Stateless authoritative SDK readers avoid stale adapter caches and usage-ledger writes. Targeted regressions cover SDK and installed no-git CLI with no Git executable, compact TOON round trips, JSON byte ceilings, typed refusals, missing sources and concurrent file changes. Full release gates are delegated to the existing CI npm/Bun matrix because the host is saturated."
  "2026-10-21T22:24:44.395Z",codex-agent,"Read-only public-tracker experiment at upstream base 42de04b: 82 real items, 85 sections, 84 sources; complete manifest 10791 JSON bytes, record 821.89 ms. Unchanged: 85 reused, 0 invalidated, 394 JSON / 381 TOON bytes, 1424.83 ms. Item/settings/evidence changed: 4 invalidated, 81 unchanged, 770 / 778 bytes, 2076.98 ms. Deleted prerequisite plus unreadable evidence: SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE, 3 invalidated, 82 unchanged, 2 unavailable sources, 718 / 721 bytes, 733.70 ms. All checked trees remained byte-identical. No Git executable was available. Methodology and reproducible script are linked; timings are observations on the saturated shared host."
  "2026-10-21T22:26:11.051Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: removed only the changed-source digest comparison from resumeFreshness, leaving real source reads and all other logic intact. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"same adapter\" test/freshness.test.ts failed 0/1 (exit 1): FRESH was returned where STALE was required after an authoritative item change. Restored the comparison; the targeted suite passes. No histories were rewritten and no stash was used."
  "2026-10-21T22:27:44.605Z",codex-agent,"Final local linked checks passed 3/3 through pm test --run --progress --workspace-context source --pm-context schema: npm run typecheck; npm run docstring; node --test test/freshness.test.ts test/context-pack.test.ts test/renderer-ownership.test.ts (72/72, zero failures/skips). New freshness.ts targeted source coverage measures 100% statements, branches, functions and lines; unchanged package thresholds remain for CI. Tracker test-result tracking is disabled, so this comment preserves the execution receipt without changing configuration. Test-only fixes isolated child CLI environment from the linked-runner source-workspace context and asserted expected SDK harness rejections."
  "2026-10-21T22:29:12.074Z",codex-agent,"PR #165 is ready for review against main and explicitly must merge after #164; origin/feat/since-delta-pack was fetched and merged again immediately before pushing afbaebe. Existing maintenance item pm-context-595f already covers local strict-health extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew and merge_fence_drift findings, so no duplicate follow-up was created and no merge configuration was changed. Clean CI checkout tracker health and committed-build verification have passed on Node 22; full release gates are running at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/actions/runs/39686732536."
  "2026-10-21T22:31:52.110Z",codex-agent,"Full CI succeeded at afbaebe: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/actions/runs/39686732536 . Node 22 and Node 26 each passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 372/372 tests per run, zero failures/skips; four successful release-gate runs. Native coverage gate reported all 11 intended runtime sources and met unchanged 100% line/branch/function thresholds; c8 aggregate measured 100% statements, 99.94% branches, 100% functions and 100% lines against unchanged thresholds. Freshness source itself remains 100/100/100/100. CI health, committed build, changelog, audit and package checks passed. Automated reviewer skips/diff limits are missing review evidence, not approval. Acceptance is met; PR #165 remains unmerged and unreleased for review after #164."
  "2026-10-22T10:23:47.178Z",codex-agent,"Review round for PR #165: pulled the remote head, verified main already present, and merged updated feat/since-delta-pack at 7115b151c232320b992cd2063f0518d97b9f186a (merge 8db640b). GraphQL reports zero review threads and no CodeRabbit review body; its issue comment skips automatic review, so no outside-diff findings or approval are available. DeepScan defect 238090979 is UNUSED_IMPORT: FreshnessSource in test/freshness.test.ts has no references. Remove the binding and enforce noUnusedLocals in the existing test build as a compiler regression guard. That guard also exposes two unused opts assignments in coverage-gaps tests; remove only those bindings while retaining the awaited rank-options calls. This keeps the guard applicable to the full test/source graph. No runtime behavior or coverage threshold changes. Rebuild committed dist, prove isolated compiler reverts, run linked real-tracker checks and full npm/Bun gates in CI."
  "2026-10-22T10:26:06.731Z",codex-agent,"Compiler revert proofs use npm run build:test with noUnusedLocals enabled. Reintroducing only FreshnessSource into the type import fails with exit 1 and TS6196 at test/freshness.test.ts. Restoring only the two previous opts bindings, with the import still fixed, independently fails with exit 1 and two TS6133 diagnostics in test/coverage-gaps.test.ts. Each source mutation was restored in finally; the restored compiler gate passes exit 0. This is a static unused-binding regression, not a runtime behavior change. The stricter test build scans the complete test/source graph; no other unused-local diagnostics remain. The two rank-options awaits still execute. All coverage thresholds and dependency pins are unchanged."
  "2026-10-22T10:32:30.440Z",codex-agent,"Local verification at ea80ef2266db62df7a088609043a46404b080e79 passes all four linked commands: typecheck, docstrings, real non-git freshness/context/renderer suite 72/72 (zero failures/cancellations/skips/todos), and strict build:test. npm ci, production build, changelog generation/check, privacy, append-only prefix and whitespace checks pass. Rebuilt dist is byte-identical to committed output. DeepScan now succeeds on this exact head with 0 new issues. Local health exits 0 but ok=false from the existing host-extension version skew; stale-work and legacy provenance findings are advisory. No merge_receipts_pending, no reconciliation or history repair needed. CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/actions/runs/39763666997 is queued for the full unchanged npm/Bun gates on Node 22 and 26. No reviewer approval is claimed."
  "2026-10-22T10:37:24.822Z",codex-agent,"Verified code-gate receipt at ea80ef2266db62df7a088609043a46404b080e79: CI run 39763666997 Node 26 completes npm run release:check AND bun run release:check, each 374/374 with zero failures/cancellations/skips/todos. Native coverage passes unchanged 100% lines/branches/functions across all 11 required sources; c8 passes unchanged thresholds with 100% statements/lines/functions and 99.94% branches. CI clean-checkout strict health, committed dist, changelog, audit, packaging and attestation pass. DeepScan succeeds with 0 new issues. Node 22 is queued at this receipt timestamp; it is not counted as passed here. Final-head matrix status will be verified before handoff. All four linked local commands pass, including 72/72 runtime tests and the stricter test compiler. Isolated TS6196 and TS6133 compiler revert proofs are recorded above. No review threads exist, no outside-diff review body is available, and no finding was refused. Final follow-up only records receipts and releases the claim; no runtime, pin, threshold, history or merge-configuration rewrite."
  "2026-10-22T21:00:38.183Z",codex-agent,"Production follow-up: pulled PR #165, merged current origin/main at 61d6a5fe7ad8c50e2e69576d6812d6696be7abbe and latest parent PR #164 head 9c2e9c8995a54e6c360ba2aee8f2557437290dba. Both merges are clean; GitHub currently reports #164 OPEN rather than squash-merged, so re-fetch before final gates. Keep the five since resume-reliability fixes on this branch and their detailed proofs on pm-context-8bbh. Preserve existing freshness behavior, pinned dependencies, thresholds and append-only histories. Regenerate changelog, rebuild dist and run full npm/Bun release gates after integration."
  "2026-10-22T21:20:57.504Z",codex-agent,"Integrated squash 96bb6aeb210139f2b2bf8d5a4b2c60c07127012f after it appeared on main. All sixteen conflicting main blobs match the already-integrated parent, and complete main history remains an unchanged byte prefix. Preserved those versions with freshness and production fixes, without history rewriting. The SDK merge driver rejects this shared creation after squash as duplicate identity. The single reconciliation attempt found zero pending receipts and repaired zero streams; it returned ok=false only for existing merge-fence drift tracked by pm-context-595f. No further merge-configuration or history repair attempted. Targeted since tests pass 26/26. Packing 125/250/500 rows took 29.06/50.00/127.70 ms with two complete-response serializations each. Native lines/functions are 100%; branch coverage and isolated controls remain under verification, so full acceptance is pending."
  "2026-10-22T21:38:48.183Z",codex-agent,"Whole-PR same-class review also found repeated whole-result trimming and section-array searches in freshness.ts. Added exact-byte incremental JSON/TOON prefix packing and per-call section ID maps without changing result semantics. New real-SDK 256-section regression passes both formats, omission counts, immutable results and exact budget boundaries. Two isolated controls using node --test --test-name-pattern=\"wide freshness packets\" test/freshness.test.ts fail 1/1 each, exit 1: restoring the old encoder causes 238 complete JSON encodes, while restoring both section find lookups causes 768 full section searches instead of zero. Both functions were restored exactly; together with pm-context-8bbh this is eleven demonstrated behavioral controls. The three refreshed wide-packet/TZ/packing tests pass 3/3; since coverage passes strict 100% lines/branches/functions. Earlier linked freshness run passed 4/4 commands and 72/72 runtime tests before the additional optimization; rerun the final linked commands and full npm/Bun gates now. The optional Python tiktoken module is unavailable, so existing token totals are explicitly historical rather than claims for the larger production receipt. Updated benchmark runner requires explicit handoff markers, own claims and zero timestamp/compaction omissions. Current packing time/byte measurements and reproduction are documented separately."
  "2026-10-22T21:48:12.559Z",codex-agent,"Final integration receipt: PR #165 now contains squash 96bb6aeb210139f2b2bf8d5a4b2c60c07127012f. Code ce20761ff568d4a3a0d9052143a6469bc5e39a32 passes CI run 39859226627 with full npm/Bun release checks on Node 22/26: four gates, each 384/384, zero failures/cancellations/skips/todos. Native coverage passes all 11 sources at 100% lines/branches/functions; c8 passes 100% statements/lines/functions and 99.94% branches at unchanged thresholds. CI strict health, dist rebuild equality, changelog, audit and package/attestation checks pass; DeepScan reports 0 new issues. Final linked freshness run passes 4/4 commands including 73/73 runtime tests, typecheck, docstrings and build:test. Since linked tests pass 19/19 plus 7/7 after clone-local acknowledgement of inherited parent-branch commands. Source bytes are restored after all eleven behavioral controls. Archive checks prove all 84 main history streams and all 84 original PR-head streams remain unchanged byte prefixes; no existing history rewritten. SDK add/add merge rejection after squash and linked-test branch provenance are tooling limitations; the single reconcile attempt had zero pending receipts and zero repairs, returning non-green only for existing merge-fence drift. Existing local host-extension/provenance warnings remain separate from clean CI health. GraphQL reports zero review threads and no CodeRabbit review body for #165; the five findings came from the supplied #164 review, and no findings were refused. Final follow-up records evidence and releases claims only; final-head CI will be verified before stopping. No PR merge, release, review reply or resolution."
